# 🎯 LESSON 3 — WORK ON THE RIGHT THINGS

This is one of the most important chapters.

The book explicitly emphasizes **"Work on the Right Things."** ([IIITD Library][2])

Ask yourself every morning:

> **"If I could accomplish only ONE important thing today, what would it be?"**

That becomes your **MIT — Most Important Task**.

For you, it could be:

**Today → 3 hours of Infosys preparation**

rather than:

* rearranging your notes
* watching random motivational videos
* checking LinkedIn
* organizing folders
