# ⏱️ LESSON 7 — THE 5-MINUTE RULE

Another technique covered by the book is the **5-Minute Rule**. ([IIITD Library][2])

When a task feels overwhelming, tell yourself:

> **"I'll do it for only five minutes."**

Not:

> "I have to finish the entire chapter."

Just:

### Open the book.

Read one page.

Then another.

Often the hardest part is **starting**.

Once momentum begins, continuing becomes easier.

